			"Message": "docs(Cocoon): Update README badges and Codegen section\n\nRefresh the README.md header badges to use singular label names (\"Update\", \"Issue\", \"Download\") and fix the Download badge URL to point to the total downloads endpoint. Rewrite the Code Generation Pipeline description to more accurately reflect the module's behavior — it scans upstream sources to derive schema files rather than walking a tree to emit schemas.\n\nThese changes improve badge consistency across the CodeEditorLand ecosystem and better communicate Cocoon's architecture to new contributors.",
